<PageTitle>About — Vino della casa</PageTitle>

<h1>About</h1>
<p>
  <strong>Vino della casa</strong> is a local-first Blazor WebAssembly cellar app:
  inventory, bin locations, and a deterministic “drink tonight” helper.
  Data stays in the browser (IndexedDB); no account required for the MVP.
</p>
<p class="muted">Portfolio project — .NET / Blazor WASM, tests, and CI.</p>
